schema: "0.4"
id: npl-ux-d3-dual-sidebar-canvas-data-console
type: image
quality: high

# Direction D3: dual sidebar + wide canvas — screen: schema tree, SQL console, results grid, tenant scope chip, write-approval banner
# Nocturne palette (exact hexes, dark-native canvas — never pure #000/#fff): canvas #010409, panel #0d1117, raised #161b22, border #21262d, primary text #e6edf3 (soft off-white ink), secondary text #909dab, muted text #6e7681, signal green (live/primary accent) #3fb950, link cyan (navigation) #58a6ff, amber (rare warning) #d29922, error coral #f85149. Type: Inter for UI/labels, JetBrains Mono (co-equal voice) for counts, timestamps, ids, code, SQL, paths. Shape: flat surfaces separated by lightness steps only, 4px radius, no drop shadows, no glow, no gradients, no neon bloom, no OLED pitch-black, no pure-white surfaces.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity dark-native app UI
    for NoizuPromptLingo. This direction is a DUAL-SIDEBAR + WIDE CANVAS shell: a
    240px left nav sidebar (with labels) and a 320px right inspector sidebar,
    flanking a wide central canvas meant for dense data-console or board work.
    Render as a real product screenshot, never a wireframe.
  text: |
        A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of NoizuPromptLingo's Data screen, testing
        the DUAL-SIDEBAR + CANVAS shell direction: schema tree (240px) | SQL
        console (wide canvas) | inspector (320px).

        LEFT SIDEBAR (240px, labeled, panel tone #0d1117): nav header "Acme
        Robotics ▾", labeled destination list with "Data" active (green left
        edge, bold), and below it a SCHEMA TREE: a service picker "prod-db
        (postgres) ▾", then expandable schema nodes "public" expanded showing
        tables "users", "sessions" (selected/highlighted), "tickets",
        "artifacts", each with a small row-count mono hint ("14,203 rows").

        TOP OF CANVAS: a TENANT SCOPE CHIP — a small pill reading "scope:
        org:acme-robotics" in cyan-on-raised styling, pinned near the console
        header, unmissable. Directly below it, a horizontal WRITE-APPROVAL
        BANNER on amber-tinted background (#d29922 accent, not filling the
        whole banner — thin left edge + icon) reading "Write statements require
        approval — this console is read-only by default."

        CENTER CANVAS (dominant, ~wide): a MONOSPACE SQL EDITOR pane (JetBrains
        Mono, syntax-colored using only theme colors) with realistic content:
        "SELECT id, status, started_at\nFROM sessions\nWHERE status = 'running'\nORDER
        BY started_at DESC\nLIMIT 50;" and a green "Run" button with a small
        ⌘⏎ hint. BELOW the editor, a RESULTS GRID (dense data table, hairline
        row separators, mono cell values): columns "id", "status", "started_at"
        — status column values color-coded (green "running", muted "completed").
        A results footer shows "50 rows · 82ms" in mono muted text.

        RIGHT SIDEBAR (320px, raised tone #161b22): an INSPECTOR panel for the
        selected "sessions" table — column list with types ("id · uuid", "status
        · text", "started_at · timestamptz", "org_id · uuid, fk → orgs.id"),
        a small "Indexes" section (2 mono index names), and an "Audit" mini-
        panel showing the last 2 query log rows with mono timestamps and
        truncated query text.

        Use realistic, specific product content throughout — never lorem ipsum.

  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, neon glow, bloom, CRT scanlines, gradient background, pure-black OLED background, pure-white surfaces, warm amber/gold dominant palette, light-mode canvas"

attachments:
  - path: _nocturne-palette.png
    role: reference
    description: "Locked Nocturne palette swatches (bg, surface, border, text, muted, accent, success, danger) with hex labels — match these exact colors, do not reinterpret."

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

service: gemini
provider_options:
  generate_content_model: gemini-2.5-flash-image

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Shows a left schema-tree sidebar with an expanded table list, a tenant-scope chip, a write-requires-approval banner, a central monospace SQL editor with a run button feeding a results data grid, and a right inspector sidebar with column types, indexes, and audit rows"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Dark-native Nocturne canvas (#010409/#0d1117), single phosphor-green #3fb950 signal, link cyan #58a6ff, amber #d29922 used sparingly, mono-first counts/timestamps/ids in JetBrains Mono, 4px radius, flat surface-step elevation, no shadow/glow/gradient"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear 240px | wide canvas | 320px proportions, scope chip and approval banner unmissable at the top of the canvas, editor-above-grid split reads as one console"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "neon glow, bloom, or gradient wash"
    - "light-mode or warm/gold dominant canvas instead of dark-native Nocturne"

tags: [ux-overhaul, npl-nocturne, NoizuPromptLingo, shell-direction, direction-3]
